@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:30020
@tourId = tour-example

### Enable the optional durable tour configuration first. This accepted work fails with 422.
POST {{baseUrl}}/async-function/fibonacci1/tour/dlq/{{tourId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"tour-order"}

### Inspect this run's failure, then its body in the dashboard.
GET {{baseUrl}}/data/dead-letters/fibonacci1/messages?httpStatus=422

### Repair the simulated shared dependency before replaying the captured DLQ message ID.
POST {{baseUrl}}/data/sets/{{tourId}}-dlq-ready?ttl=600000
Content-Type: text/plain

ready

### Verify the completion marker matches the replay receipt's ElementId.
GET {{baseUrl}}/data/sets/{{tourId}}-dlq-completed
